\cf2 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Minutes later, Johnny appeared at the back gate, confidently adorned in a casually flashy suit. He paused at the threshold like an actor awaiting his cue, then let himself in with the presumption of someone who never recalled being told no.\
